# One-off diagnostic scripts.
#
# NOTE: these globs are why DESIGN.md can reference a `check_token_migration.py`
# pre-commit hook that is absent from the repository — a permanent quality gate was
# named like a throwaway and got ignored out of existence. Permanent gates must be
# negated below, not just named carefully.
scripts/check_*.py
# Permanent gates — must stay tracked despite the check_*.py glob above.
# Note: gitignore has no inline comments, so each negation gets its own line.
!scripts/check_design_tokens.py
!scripts/check_shell_conformance.py
!scripts/check_external_origins.py
!scripts/check_sri.py
!scripts/check_deployed_deps.py
