# --- Local scratch / working files ---------------------------------------------
# Ad-hoc scripts and dumps that accumulate at the repo root during investigation.
# Listed explicitly rather than with broad globs (build_*.py, seed_*.py) so a
# legitimately-named future module is not silently untracked.
#
# CI scans the FULL git history with gitleaks, so an accidental `git add -A` that
# commits a dump containing real data is expensive to undo. Prefer putting new
# throwaway work in scratch/ below.
scratch/
b_gz.html
b_plain.html
h_gz.txt
h_plain.txt
build_diagram.py
build_engagement.py
build_phase5.py
codegen_incontainer.py
seed_caps_overlap.py
seed_sap_sfdc.py

# Ad-hoc REPL scripts that reached the repo root and were committed by accident
# (qc.py, si.py, readgen.py, recheck.py — 11-19 lines each, one with a hardcoded
# solution_id=11, referenced by nothing). Deleted 2026-08-03. Named explicitly
# rather than by glob so a legitimately-named future module is not swallowed.
qc.py
si.py
readgen.py
recheck.py
.worktrees/

